    "experiment": "V12 AI-OFF Reality Test",
    "purpose": "Independent ground truth for the deterministic-only product. Authored from first principles (classification rules in recovery_intelligence.classify_inventory and decision rules in ab_decision_framework.deterministic_decision_for_item in the V12 codebase). NOT fed into the engine at any point. Each case describes the designed per-SKU sales/inventory inputs and the EXPECTED classification + deterministic decision.",
